          <ul style="margin-bottom: 0;">
            <li><p>HTML, CSS, Javascript, Jquery</p></li>
            <li><p>AJAX, JSON, SEO</p></li>
            <li><p>GSAP, Lottie, React JS, Astro</p></li>
            <li><p>PHP, SQL</p></li>
            
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="eaGroup">
          <h5 class="bold">Software</h5>
        </div>
        <div class="imgGroup">
          <div class="singleSoftware">
            <img src="https://tzejian3012.netlify.app/files/media/excel.png" alt="">
            <p>Excel</p>
          </div>
          <div class="singleSoftware">
            <img src="https://tzejian3012.netlify.app/files/media/powerpoint.png" alt="">
            <p>Powerpoint</p>
          </div>
          <div class="singleSoftware">
            <img src="https://tzejian3012.netlify.app/files/media/word.png" alt="">
            <p>Word</p>
          </div>
       
        </div>
        <div class="imgGroup">
          <div class="singleSoftware">
            <img src="https://tzejian3012.netlify.app/files/media/pr.png" alt="">
            <p>Photoshop</p>
          </div>
          <div class="singleSoftware">
            <img src="https://tzejian3012.netlify.app/files/media/ps.png" alt="">
            <p>Premier Pro</p>
          </div>
          <div class="singleSoftware">
            <img src="https://tzejian3012.netlify.app/files/media/ai.png" alt="">
            <p>Illustrator</p>
          </div>
          <div class="singleSoftware">
            <img src="https://tzejian3012.netlify.app/files/media/xd.png" alt="">
            <p>Xd</p>
          </div>
          <div class="singleSoftware">
            <img src="https://tzejian3012.netlify.app/files/media/figma.png" alt="">
            <p>Figma</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="eaGroup">
          <h5 class="bold">Soft Skills</h5>
          <p>Proficient in Mandarin and English</p>
          <p>Able to read Traditional Chinese.</p>
          <p>Excellent communication and teamwork skills</p>
        </div>
        
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg-12" data-inView="slideIn">
      <div class="textbox border">
        <h2>Work Experience</h2>
        <div class="eaGroup">
          <h5 class="bold">Aonva solutions / Ux Analyst (2023 - 2024)</h5>
          <p>UI/UX analyst and designing components during my time here.</p>
          
          <p>My responsibilities are:</p>
          <style>
            .about li{
              margin-bottom: 10px;
            }
          </style>
          <ul class="about">
            <li><p>Research other market ui design for competitors.</p></li>
            <li><p>Adapt images for company products.</p></li>
            <li><p>Design loading screen banner pages.</p></li>
          </ul>

        </div>
        <div class="eaGroup">
          <h5 class="bold">Human & Human / Front-end web developer (2018 - 2023)</h5>
          <p>During my time at the agency, I had the privilege to contribute to an array of projects, catering to prestigious clients including DBS Bank, GIC, Como Group, as well as pursuing independent side projects.</p>
          
          <p>My responsibilities are:</p>
          <style>
            .about li{
              margin-bottom: 10px;
            }
          </style>
          <ul class="about">
            <li><p>Coding projects from scratch, breathing life into digital concepts and bringing them to reality.</p></li>
            <li><p>Adapting seamlessly to designer's visions, ensuring the translation of designs into functional and visually captivating web interfaces.</p></li>
            <li><p>Designing intricate modules of websites, meticulously crafting user experiences that align with business objectives.</p></li>
            <li><p>Expertly maintaining and launching websites, consistently delivering polished and impactful end products.</p></li>
          </ul>
          
          <p>My journey in this role unveiled the multifaceted nature of being a front-end developer. Beyond the realm of code, it's about weaving designs into seamless user interactions. </p>

        </div>
        <div class="eaGroup">
          <h5 class="bold">6Connect / Software engineer intern (2017 - 2018)</h5>
          <p>I actively contributed to the development of new website functionalities and played a key role in creating API documentation to enhance the website's capabilities during my internship in Taiwan. This experience has not only expanded my technical skills but also honed my ability to effectively communicate and collaborate within a diverse and culturally rich environment.</p>
        </div>
        
        
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-12" data-inView="slideIn">
      <div class="textbox border">
        <h2>education</h2>
        <div class="eaGroup">
          <h5 class="bold">Online Courses (2022 - 2023)</h5>
          <p>User Experience (UX) Design by Google</p>
          <p>Fundamentals of digital marketing by Google</p>
          <p>Introduction to User Experience Design by Georgia Institute of Technology</p>
        </div>
        <div class="eaGroup">
          <h5 class="bold">Republic polytechnic (2015 - 2018)</h5>
          <p>Diploma in mobile software development</p>
        </div>
        <div class="eaGroup">
